size = <width = 1200>
desc="The ordinate is different cell groups, and the abscissa is specific marker genes’ expression levels. "

%result
@title
Functional Enrichment Analysis
@paragraph
Significat differently expressed Genes(DEGs, adjust P-value < 0.05 && Log2FC > 0.5) were screened from all Marker genes in each cell cluster. ClusterProfiler was used to conduct functional enrichment analysis of GO (Gene Ontology) and KEGG (Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes) categories\reference{4}. Enrichment results are shown from Figure 13 to 14.

@subtitle
number = 1
 GO enrichment analysis 
@paragraph
